*   [MoEngage iOS SDK — Push Notification Handling](https://developers.moengage.com/hc/en-us/articles/4403895168788-Push-Notifications) — Documents how MoEngage swizzles notification delegate methods and recommended integration patterns to avoid threading issues.

## Overview

The app crashes intermittently while running in the foreground when Firebase Remote Config&#39;s realtime update listener receives a network response containing fragmented JSON data. The crash happens inside Firebase&#39;s own SDK code — not in app-authored code — when it tries to extract a substring from malformed chunk boundaries, resulting in an invalid (negative-length) string range. This is a known Firebase SDK defect fixed in version 11.10.0; updating the SDK will eliminate the crash entirely.

